ped in previous years were approximately 3.0% and 2.6% of U.S. Innovative Medicine revenue during the fiscal second quarter of 2026 and 2025, respectively and approximately 3.8% and 3.5% of U.S. Innovative Medicine revenue during the fiscal six months of 2026 and 2025, respectively .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Johnson Text',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%"&gt;In October 2025, the Company announced its intention to separate its Orthopaedics business.  The Company continues to explore multiple paths to effect the planned separation with a targeted completion within 18 to 24 months after the initial announcement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:4pt;margin-top:4pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Johnson Text',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:130%"&gt;Segment income before tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:5pt"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:98.994%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:40.554%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.525%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:8.624%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:8.624%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:7.027%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.525%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:8.914%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="w